        "content": "## Morning Brief\nSends today's agenda by text at 6:00 AM daily.\nMake sure your n8n instance timezone is set to America/New_York (Settings) so this fires at 6 AM local time.\nWhen you reconnect your second Google Calendar account, add a third \"Get Today\" branch for it and wire it into Combine All Calendars.",
